{
  "info": {
    "name": "AI Try-On Backend",
    "_postman_id": "ai-try-on-backend-v1",
    "description": "# AI Try-On Backend API\n\n## Genel Bilgiler\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost:8000/api/v1`\n\n**Authentication:** JWT Bearer Token\n\n### Kimlik Doğrulama\n1. `/auth/google/` veya `/auth/apple/` endpoint'lerinden giriş yap\n2. Response'daki `access` tokenı `access_token` collection variable'ına kaydet\n3. Diğer tüm isteklerde otomatik olarak `Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}` header'ı eklenir\n\n### Standard Response Formatı\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": { ... },\n  \"message\": null\n}\n```\n\n### Pagination\nSayfalı endpoint'lerde query param olarak `page` ve `page_size` (max 100) kullanılır.\n\n### Status Kodları\n- `200` OK\n- `201` Created\n- `202` Accepted (async işlemler)\n- `400` Bad Request\n- `401` Unauthorized\n- `404` Not Found",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Kimlik doğrulama ve kullanıcı profili endpoint'leri.\n\nGiriş yapıldığında dönen `access` ve `refresh` token'lar collection variable'larına otomatik kaydedilir.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Google Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', res.data.access);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', res.data.refresh);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/google/",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"<google_id_token>\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Google OAuth ID token ile giriş yap.\n\n**token:** Google'dan alınan ID token (Firebase veya Google Sign-In SDK'sından)\n\nBaşarılı girişte JWT `access` ve `refresh` token döner. Test script'i bu token'ları otomatik olarak collection variable'larına kaydeder."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Başarılı Giriş (201)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/google/",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"<google_id_token>\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"access\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxLCJleHAiOjE3MDAwMDAwMDB9.abc123\",\n    \"refresh\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxLCJleHAiOjE3MDAwMDAwMDB9.def456\",\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"email\": \"kullanici@gmail.com\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Emre Yılmaz\",\n      \"photo_url\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/photo.jpg\",\n      \"height_cm\": null,\n      \"weight_kg\": null,\n      \"chest_cm\": null,\n      \"waist_cm\": null,\n      \"hips_cm\": null\n    }\n  },\n  \"message\": null\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Geçersiz Token (400)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/google/",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"gecersiz_token\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"data\": null,\n  \"message\": \"Geçersiz Google token.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Apple Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', res.data.access);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', res.data.refresh);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/apple/",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"<apple_identity_token>\",\n  \"display_name\": \"Emre\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Apple Sign In identity token ile giriş yap.\n\n**token:** Apple'dan alınan identity token\n**display_name:** (opsiyonel) Kullanıcı adı — sadece ilk girişte Apple'dan gelir, sonraki girişlerde gönderilmez\n\nBaşarılı girişte JWT `access` ve `refresh` token döner."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Başarılı Giriş (201)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/apple/",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"<apple_identity_token>\",\n  \"display_name\": \"Emre\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"access\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoyLCJleHAiOjE3MDAwMDAwMDB9.abc123\",\n    \"refresh\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoyLCJleHAiOjE3MDAwMDAwMDB9.def456\",\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": 2,\n      \"email\": \"kullanici@privaterelay.appleid.com\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Emre\",\n      \"photo_url\": null,\n      \"height_cm\": null,\n      \"weight_kg\": null,\n      \"chest_cm\": null,\n      \"waist_cm\": null,\n      \"hips_cm\": null\n    }\n  },\n  \"message\": null\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Token Yenile",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.access) pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', res.access);",
                  "if (res.refresh) pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', res.refresh);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/refresh/",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Access token süresi dolduğunda yeni token almak için kullanılır.\n\n**refresh:** Collection variable'dan otomatik alınır. Access token genellikle 5 dakika, refresh token 7 gün geçerlidir.\n\nBaşarılı response'da yeni `access` token döner, test script collection variable'ı günceller."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Başarılı Token Yenileme (200)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/refresh/",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"refresh\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"access\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxLCJleHAiOjE3MDAwMDAwMDB9.newtoken\",\n  \"refresh\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxLCJleHAiOjE3MDAwMDAwMDB9.newrefresh\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Geçersiz/Süresi Dolmuş Refresh Token (401)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/refresh/",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"refresh\": \"gecersiz_token\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"detail\": \"Token is invalid or expired\",\n  \"code\": \"token_not_valid\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
